WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
- [Kelly Clarkson] All right,

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.160
let's close out the
hour with something fun.

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.720
I found scrolling through social media.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.428
This is what I'm liking!

00:00:05.428 --> 00:00:07.950
(audience cheers)

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.050
All hour, we've been celebrating the world

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.900
of Super Mario Brothers,
because it's a great day.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.060
Um, it's among plenty
of classic games kids

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:17.910
and many grownups are still
playing decades later,

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:19.110
after it came out.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:21.210
Um, and one Utah mama is helping boys

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.920
and girls embrace their love of that game

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.010
and many more by teaching
video game, gaming classes.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:26.843
Actually,

00:00:26.843 --> 00:00:28.080
she says it helps kids

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.110
with problem solving and
confidence in a safe setting.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.989
We have her on the line
right now watching on KSL TV.

00:00:33.989 --> 00:00:35.940
Everybody give it up for Devin.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:36.773
What's up, Devin?

00:00:36.773 --> 00:00:38.340
(audience cheering)

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.309
- Hey Kelly.

00:00:39.309 --> 00:00:40.280
How's it going?

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.113
- [Kelly Clarkson] Hello.

00:00:41.113 --> 00:00:42.870
So basically, this is awesome.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:45.000
You just teach kids how to
play video games, right?

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.290
How did you get into this?

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.750
- So I've been a gamer my entire life.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.780
Remember playing Mario
on the Super Nintendo and

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:52.613
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah

00:00:52.613 --> 00:00:54.120
- we moved to Utah, so
that my husband could go

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.640
to dental school, and I
knew I, we would need some

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.980
supplemental income to pay
for our four daughter's

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:02.070
dance classes and singing
classes and everything.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.110
And so I started teaching online

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:06.540
and initially I was
teaching Spanish classes,

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:07.440
but instead of saying

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:10.620
like the apple is red
or the banana is yellow

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:11.730
I would say things like,

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:14.048
Mario is red and Pikachu is yellow.

00:01:14.048 --> 00:01:16.800
And so my students
started asking me for help

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:17.640
in the games they're playing.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:18.840
They're like, I'm stuck on this level.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.160
Can you please help me?

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:21.600
And I said, well, you know what?

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.510
Why don't I make some video
game social clubs for us

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:26.190
and then I'll help you out with it.

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:29.880
And so now I teach about 18
video game social clubs a week.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:32.850
My students are anywhere
from nine to 12 years old

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:35.100
and they get to come
and it's amazing because

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.320
it's a safe place where
they can game, you know?

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:38.153
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:01:38.153 --> 00:01:39.840
- Video gaming can be really toxic.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:41.130
And so in my classes

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.900
they know that they're
accepted and that it's safe.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:44.730
- You're such a rad mom to do this.

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:46.050
What a cool mom you are.

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.241
So how do these classes work?

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.680
(audience clapping)

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.397
- So what we do in my classes is,

00:01:51.397 --> 00:01:52.680
they'll sign up for a class.

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:54.450
So let's say they come
to a Mario Kart class

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:56.100
and I'll say all right guys,

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.300
today we're gonna play Mario Kart.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.200
Let's do some races.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.430
And I kind of turn it over to them.

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:01.980
I'm like, where do you guys
want to go on Mario Kart?

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:02.813
What should we do?

00:02:02.813 --> 00:02:04.415
They're like, let's do
this level, let's do this.

00:02:04.415 --> 00:02:06.180
And we have a great time

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.520
except they always seem to go after me.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.760
I am the main target every
single time we play a game.

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.530
But it's so much fun.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:14.580
I just, I love it.

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:15.960
It's the best job ever.

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:17.220
- Ah, that's so cool.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.053
Thank you so much, Devin.

00:02:18.053 --> 00:02:20.640
And hey, I'm gonna start
praying for your husband now,

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.500
that's a lot of women in one house

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:23.610
just saying

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.620
my thoughts and prayers for him.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.814
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:28.650
Right!

00:02:28.650 --> 00:02:29.483
- Oh, thank you.

00:02:29.483 --> 00:02:31.560
Thank you, Kelly. Thank you so much.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:32.700
- Well, that's not all girl.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:35.010
Our season long partner
Pilot Pen makers of G2,

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.630
the go-to pin of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.730
wanting to honor truly unstoppable people

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:39.930
just like yourself, ma'am.

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:41.670
So they're gonna write you a
check for a thousand dollars.

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:42.520
How's that sound?

00:02:44.825 --> 00:02:45.658
- Wow. Thank you.

00:02:45.658 --> 00:02:46.710
Thank you so much, Kelly.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:47.543
Appreciate it.

00:02:47.543 --> 00:02:48.930
- [Kelly Clarkson]
Absolutely. Got a lot of kids.

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:51.330
So there you go. Thank you so much.

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:52.890
And thank you to all our guests this hour.

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:55.320
Chris Pratt, Jack Black, Charlie Day,

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.720
Keegan-Michael Key, Guy Branum,
and Meet Me at the Altar

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.430
Y'all have a great day
and well, if it's not

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:00.330
try and change it.

